---
# Catch2 assertions are macros: REQUIRE/CHECK/REQUIRE_FALSE expand to
# `do { ... } while (false)` and to unparenthesised statement sequences, so the
# checks below fire on every assertion rather than on project code.
#
# misc-use-anonymous-namespace is off for the same reason: TEST_CASE expands to
# a `static void dummyFunctionN()` in the global namespace, which the check
# would want moved into an anonymous namespace — it cannot see through the
# macro, so every test case is reported.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >-
  -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-do-while,
  -bugprone-macro-parentheses,
  -misc-use-anonymous-namespace
